{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "漏写一条",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 100.56,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "电路最常见的漏洞，叫约束不足。",
   "spoken": "电路最常见的漏洞，叫约束不足。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 1.694,
   "speechEnd": 4.483
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "某个值被算出来了，却没有被约束。",
   "spoken": "某个值被算出来了，却没有被约束。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 4.94,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 5.04,
   "speechEnd": 7.601
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "在 Circom 语言里，有一种写法只赋值，不约束。另一种写法，赋值的同时加上约束。",
   "spoken": "在 Circom 语言里，有一种写法只赋值，不约束。另一种写法，赋值的同时加上约束。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 8.04,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 8.04,
   "speechEnd": 15.59
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "只用了前一种写法的信号，恶意证明者可以填任何值。",
   "spoken": "只用了前一种写法的信号，恶意证明者可以填任何值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 16.02,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 16.02,
   "speechEnd": 20.577
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "看一个玩具例子。账户余额是 20，有人要提款 25。",
   "spoken": "看一个玩具例子。账户余额是 20，有人要提款 25。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 21.04,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 21.135,
   "speechEnd": 26.31
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "电路要求，新余额拆成 5 个二进制位，每一位只能是 0 或 1。",
   "spoken": "电路要求，新余额拆成 5 个二进制位，每一位只能是 0 或 1。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 26.7,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 26.7,
   "speechEnd": 32.086
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "只去掉最高位的这一条，恶意证明者就把最高位填成 30。",
   "spoken": "只去掉最高位的这一条，恶意证明者就把最高位填成 30。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 32.52,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 32.52,
   "speechEnd": 37.864
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "电路里的数，算到一个上限就绕回去。填 30 之后，等式照样成立。",
   "spoken": "电路里的数，算到一个上限就绕回去。填 30 之后，等式照样成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 38.26,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 38.353,
   "speechEnd": 43.961
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "余额检查被绕过，提款 25 通过了验证。",
   "spoken": "余额检查被绕过，提款 25 通过了验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 44.4,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 44.499,
   "speechEnd": 47.787
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "反过来，约束写得太严，叫过度约束。",
   "spoken": "反过来，约束写得太严，叫过度约束。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 48.22,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 48.22,
   "speechEnd": 51.562
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "合法的输入也无法生成证明，结果是拒绝服务，资金可能被锁住。",
   "spoken": "合法的输入也无法生成证明，结果是拒绝服务，资金可能被锁住。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 51.96,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 51.96,
   "speechEnd": 57.97
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "真实的例子在 2019 年。",
   "spoken": "真实的例子在 2019 年。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 58.42,
   "dur": 2.48,
   "speechStart": 58.521,
   "speechEnd": 60.663
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "按 Trail of Bits 的介绍，Tornado Cash 用的一个哈希实现里，有一个输出只被赋值，没有被约束。",
   "spoken": "按 Trail of Bits 的介绍，Tornado Cash 用的一个哈希实现里，有一个输出只被赋值，没有被约束。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 61.12,
   "dur": 8.08,
   "speechStart": 61.215,
   "speechEnd": 68.98
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "攻击者本可以伪造 Merkle 根，取走别人的资金。",
   "spoken": "攻击者本可以伪造 Merkle 根，取走别人的资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 69.42,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 69.42,
   "speechEnd": 73.072
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "团队发现后，抢先利用这个漏洞，把资金转走保护起来，再修复。",
   "spoken": "团队发现后，抢先利用这个漏洞，把资金转走保护起来，再修复。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 73.48,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 73.582,
   "speechEnd": 78.112
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "没有资金被盗。",
   "spoken": "没有资金被盗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 78.58,
   "dur": 1.2,
   "speechStart": 78.674,
   "speechEnd": 79.543
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "同类问题很多。0xPARC 维护的公开漏洞清单里，收录了大量这样的例子。",
   "spoken": "同类问题很多。0xPARC 维护的公开漏洞清单里，收录了大量这样的例子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 80.0,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 80.095,
   "speechEnd": 86.339
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "防御有三条。",
   "spoken": "防御有三条。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 86.78,
   "dur": 1.36,
   "speechStart": 86.78,
   "speechEnd": 87.895
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "用静态分析工具，找出没有约束的信号。",
   "spoken": "用静态分析工具，找出没有约束的信号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 88.36,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 88.36,
   "speechEnd": 91.637
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "关键电路，做形式化验证。",
   "spoken": "关键电路，做形式化验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 92.02,
   "dur": 2.48,
   "speechStart": 92.115,
   "speechEnd": 94.28
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "每条约束写正反两种测试，恶意的输入也要测。",
   "spoken": "每条约束写正反两种测试，恶意的输入也要测。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg3-20.wav",
   "start": 94.72,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 94.815,
   "speechEnd": 99.198
  }
